[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2930690581","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107011#issuecomment-2930690581","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107011","id":2930690581,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ursoV","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-02T13:19:52Z","updated_at":"2025-06-02T13:19:52Z","body":"Go to Project Settings and disable Half Res SSAO under environment.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2930690581/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2933150124","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107011#issuecomment-2933150124","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107011","id":2933150124,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6u1FGs","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T02:27:30Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T02:27:44Z","body":"This is a byproduct of SSAO being rendered at halved resolution. This also occurs on ceilings, so it's not a incorrect 1-pixel offset that would only affect certain edges.\n\nDisabling **SSAO Half Size** in the Project Settings mostly avoids the issue, but is much slower.\n\nHalf Size enabled | Half Size disabled\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9a805e08-5e73-4e22-a980-f6c60627747e) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d8504d4-00db-4424-ae30-426112ab3119)\n\nWhat's interesting is that if you increase **Scaling 3D Scale** to `2.0` but keep half size *enabled*, the artifact will still be fairly noticeable:\n\nHalf Size disabled | Half Size enabled + 2.0 render scale\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a184f482-e731-4eb4-92b7-f2b627b108db) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec461d67-c40c-4bd9-a4d0-89631445a2ea)\n\nIn this situation, the AO buffer has the sasme resolution as **Scaling 3D Scale** set to `1.0` but half size *disabled*.\n\nDecreasing **SSAO > Sharpness** in the environment will also make the edge more noticeable, but softer:\n\nSharpness 0.98 | Sharpness 0.0\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b71578c-1e7e-4816-bbef-981e5d96e65a) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7b79af0a-71f2-4333-b76d-06c62d82a758)\n\nTherefore, I'm not sure if it's a bug or just a byproduct of the underlying algorithm (ASSAO). Replacing ASSAO with something like [GTAO](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3223) may avoid the issue, but remember it's still a screen-space algorithm at the end of the day.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2933150124/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2934610090","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107011#issuecomment-2934610090","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107011","id":2934610090,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6u6piq","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy","html_url":"https://github.com/mrjustaguy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mrjustaguy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T10:37:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T10:37:33Z","body":"Render Scale 2.0 with half res artifact is expected, as the same artifact is still created at the higher resolution before it gets downsampled to the display res.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2934610090/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2935640617","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107011#issuecomment-2935640617","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107011","id":2935640617,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6u-lIp","user":{"login":"marcospb19","id":38900226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4OTAwMjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38900226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19","html_url":"https://github.com/marcospb19","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcospb19/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-03T14:38:48Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T14:38:48Z","body":"Thanks!! I didn't know about the `ssao/half_size` setting, closing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2935640617/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]